# MERG Production-First Rule

Before substantive work, read:
- `/AGENTS.md`
- `/merg_os/CURRENT_STATE.md`
- `/merg_os/PROJECT_REGISTRY.md`
- `/merg_os/PRODUCTION_GATES.md`
- `/merg_os/TOOL_ROUTER.md`
- `/merg_os/DEVICE_WORKFLOW.md`
- `/powerlux_os/CURRENT_STATE.md` when working on PowerLux.

Modify the real existing implementation. Do not create a replacement/mockup/demo when an original product exists or may exist.

If original source cannot be verified, mark the task blocked and recover the source first.

Do not claim live/fixed/deployed/connected/working without checking the real target system.

PowerTV specifically: canonical Git source is not yet verified. Do not reconstruct it from screenshots, copy, scraped text or memory.
